(footprint "INS-1_Recessed"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Reflector INS-1 neon glow indicator recessed into the board so its lens sits below the IN-12 digit faces. The milled 7.6 x 4.2 mm slot on Edge.Cuts passes the 7.00 x 3.35 mm pinch blade and keys its rotation, so the leads always exit along X. Above the blade the section thickens sharply to the 6.5 mm barrel, and that step seats the lamp; the transition is steep enough that seat height is insensitive to slot tolerance. A printed TPU top-hat washer lines the slot so glass never touches milled FR4, and its flange thickness sets the lens height. Insert from the front, leads first, and solder to the pads on the back. Lens lands near 19 mm above the board")
	(tags "INS-1 neon glow discharge indicator lamp nixie clock colon separator recessed slot cutout")
